cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "project_nematoda: automatic pose tracking and locomotion analysis of nematodes"
abstract: >-
  Tools that turn microscope videos of free-living nematodes into 49-point midlines
  for every worm (including touching, crossing and coiled worms), per-worm tracks,
  auto-labelled DeepLabCut projects and locomotion features.
authors:
  - family-names: Sidorov
    given-names: Mikhail
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-26
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/connectaum/project_nematoda"
keywords:
  - nematodes
  - Caenorhabditis
  - locomotion
  - pose estimation
  - DeepLabCut
  - SAM2
  - behaviour analysis
